            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.21.18+2SA.21.19+2SA.21.20+2SA.21.21+2SA.21.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 21:18-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba umuyila inshiku, paimine inkondo na Abafilisiti ku musumba wabo ku Gesa. Napali ilya ine nshita Sibekai umwina Hushati aipaya Sipai, umo uwali mu lupwa lwakwa Refa, icalengele na Abafilisiti ukucimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.17.4+1SA.17.5+1SA.17.6+1SA.17.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 17:4-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukulwa inkondo na imbi na Abafilisiti, Elianani mwana Yairi aipaya Lami munyina kwa Goliati umwina Gati, uwakwete ifumo ilyali no musako kwati mulando wa bapikula insalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakabili ku bulwi na bumbi ubwacitike ku cifulo ca Gati, kwaliko icimuntu icalunduka nganshi. Cali ne minwe mutanda kuli cila cisansa, kabili cali ne fikondo mutanda kuli cila lukasa, fyonse pamo fyali amakumi yabili na fine (24). Nao wine ali uwa mu lupwa lwakwa Rafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi ilyo ena asebenye abena Israeli, Yonatani mwana Shimea, munyina kwa Davidi ewamwipeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ebali aba mu lupwa lwakwa Rafa mu Gati, kabili bonse bafwile ku minwe yakwa Davidi na ku minwe ya bantu bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
